          "segment": null,
          "value": "Upgrade to the latest LTS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f19290b1-ce56-4496-90dd-c4750836878e",
      "key": "ce8aea67-28c3-402d-a067-9752223466f8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "mainContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe take your Umbraco site to the latest LTS \u2014 audit, upgrade plan, execution and aftercare. Staying on an old version means missing security fixes, performance gains and new editor features. It also makes the next upgrade harder, because the gap keeps growing. We help you close that gap in one planned step.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe start with an audit of your packages, custom code, integrations and hosting. From that we write an upgrade plan with a realistic estimate and a date that suits your team. The upgrade itself happens on a copy of your site, so your live site is never at risk. You review and test the upgraded copy before anything changes for your visitors.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have signed it off, we switch over and stay on hand during the first weeks. We fix anything that turns up and hand over notes on what changed. Many clients then book a yearly check to stay current without another big project.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
